<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cristaleria 1996 profit down 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cristaleria 1996 profit down 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Cristaleria group gave the following 1996 results, in billions of pesetas</p>
<p>				    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Turnover			147.68  vs    144.82</p>
<p> Exports			  25.79  vs     23.77</p>
<p> Pretax profit		  17.01  vs     16.46</p>
<p> Cash flow			26.32  vs     27.94</p>
<p> Investments		    14.90  vs     16.04</p>
<p> Debt				6.31  vs     14.04</p>
<p> Net profit		     11.65  vs     13.16</p>
<p>NOTE - Cristaleria is a unit of French glass maker Saint Gobain.</p>
<p>Cristaleria parent had turnover of 54.1 billion pesetas versus 52.38 billion pesetas in 1995, with net profit of 9.90 billion pesetas versus 7.63 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
